{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-08_beg","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-08","title":"ストレス反応","storyCode":"4-8","avgTag":"戦闘前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"11aa50001cd1573240c445eabd22a458736a53a343f2b152c6339fdbcd039b55","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ええと……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"多分、この辺りのはず……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"すでに、フロストリーフさんから送られてきた座標の近くまで来ているんですが……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"なんだか少し、嫌なにおいがしますね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"どこか焦げ臭いような……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"この場所は一体……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――！　危ない！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ッ……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン術師","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"は、外した……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"安心しろ、ここなら安全だし――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン術師","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"う、っ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"――！？　お、おい、急にどうしたんだ！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン術師","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"……っ……あ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"聞いたところで、二度と答えは得られんぞ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"な、なっ……！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"今のは――あの建物からです！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"！　待って……もしかして、あそこにいるのは――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"フロストリーフさん！　あなたですよね？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ。……安心しろ、この場の敵は片付けておいた。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"それより、心配をかけたな。アーミヤ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"……ッ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……！　どこか痛みますか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"医療班、手当をお願いします！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……これは……凍傷？　一体、何があったんですか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"この程度、かすり傷だ。問題はない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"……メテオリーテとジェシカは、まだ広場にいる……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"私がレユニオンを引きつけておいたから、恐らく気付かれてはいないだろう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"とはいえ、今は無事でも、この状況が長引けば危険に晒されることは確かだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"では、そのレユニオンは？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"すでに近くまで来ているはずだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"この場所は奥まっているし、もうしばらくはやり過ごせるだろうが……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"子ギツネさ～ん、どこに隠れてるのかな～？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"かくれんぼなんてやめて、出ておいで～。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"さもないと、1分ごとにお友達の指を一つずつ折っちゃうけど――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"君はそれでも逃げ回るつもりなのかい？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（メフィスト――！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）落ち着け。あれはハッタリだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）っ……彼は、この場所で何を……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"……よし、やり過ごせたようだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"まさか、メフィストもここへ来ていたなんて……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"いえ、とにかくまずは、メテオリーテさんたちに連絡を――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……あれ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"汚染された区域は抜けたはずなのに……どうして、通信できないんでしょうか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"……はぁ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"これを見ろ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"通信機……？　フロストリーフさんのですか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……！　凍ってる……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"一体、何が起きたんですか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"さっきいたメフィストは、あくまでオマケみたいなものだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"というのも、この廃都市には……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"奴よりもよほど恐ろしい連中がうろついているからな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"恐ろしい連中、というのは？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"スノーデビルだ。奴らに出くわせば、マズいことになる。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"スノーデビル、というと……スノーデビル小隊のことですか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"恐らくな。現状、推測でしかないが。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"だが、辺り一帯の温度が低下していることや、会敵した各部隊の状況を鑑みると……奴らの仕業としか思えない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"レユニオンの連中が、この廃都市に自らの領土を築き始めているということだろうな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――そろそろ、暗くなってきましたね……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"今のうちに、移動しましょうか。この開けた道も、気付かれずに通り抜けられそうですし。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"とにかく、まずはメテオリーテさんたちを助けに行かなくては。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"わかった。付いてこい。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"広場に何か、置かれているような……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"彫刻……でしょうか？　変わった見た目ですね……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"それに、嫌なにおいもしますし……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"あまり見ない方がいい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"それより、私のそばを離れるなよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"――レユニオンの姿があるな……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストリーフ","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"ここは、音を立てずに片付けるとしよう。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["アーミヤ"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["レユニオン構成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","aliases":["レユニオン術師"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["メフィスト"]},{"speakerId":"char_193_frostl","aliases":["？？？","フロストリーフ"]}]}
